  "model": "claude-4.6-opus-high-thinking",
  "text": "Here's a comprehensive assessment of the React Router v5 to v6 migration status in the Grafana codebase.\n\n---\n\n## React Router Migration Status: v5 → v6\n\n### Executive Summary\n\nThe Grafana codebase is in a **hybrid transitional state**. The root router infrastructure remains on **React Router v5 (5.3.4)**, while the vast majority of component-level APIs have been migrated to **v6-style** usage via the `react-router-dom-v5-compat` bridge package (resolved to 6.30.3). No v5-specific component APIs (`useHistory`, `<Switch>`, `<Redirect>`, `withRouter`, etc.) remain in use -- they've all been replaced with v6 equivalents.\n\n---\n\n### Dependency Overview\n\n| Package | Version | Role |\n|---------|---------|------|\n| `react-router` | 5.3.4 | Core router (v5) |\n| `react-router-dom` | 5.3.4 | DOM bindings (v5) |\n| `react-router-dom-v5-compat` | ^6.26.1 → 6.30.3 | v6 API bridge |\n| `@types/react-router` | 5.1.20 | v5 type definitions |\n| `@types/react-router-dom` | 5.3.3 | v5 type definitions |\n\n---\n\n### Current Architecture\n\n```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    subgraph \"Root Layer — Still v5\"\n        A[\"Router (react-router-dom v5)\"] -->|\"history v4\"| B[\"locationService.getHistory()\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"Bridge Layer\"\n        A --> C[\"CompatRouter (react-router-dom-v5-compat)\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"Component Layer — v6 APIs\"\n        C --> D[\"&lt;Routes&gt;\"]\n        D --> E[\"&lt;Route element={...} /&gt;\"]\n        E --> F[\"GrafanaRouteWrapper\"]\n        F --> G[\"GrafanaRoute\"]\n        G --> H[\"Page Components\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"Navigation\"\n        H -->|\"programmatic nav\"| I[\"locationService.push/replace\"]\n        I --> B\n        H -->|\"hooks\"| J[\"useNavigate, useParams,\\nuseLocation, useSearchParams\\n(from v5-compat)\"]\n    end\n\n    style A fill:#f9a825,stroke:#f57f17,color:#000\n    style C fill:#42a5f5,stroke:#1565c0,color:#fff\n    style D fill:#66bb6a,stroke:#2e7d32,color:#fff\n    style E fill:#66bb6a,stroke:#2e7d32,color:#fff\n```\n\n---\n\n### API Migration Progress\n\n```mermaid\npie title \"v5 → v6 API Migration Completion\"\n    \"Migrated to v6 APIs\" : 95\n    \"Remaining v5 infrastructure\" : 5\n```\n\n#### v5 APIs — Fully Removed\n\n| v5 API | Status | Replaced By |\n|--------|--------|-------------|\n| `useHistory` | Removed | `useNavigate` / `locationService` |\n| `useRouteMatch` | Removed | `useMatch` / `useParams` |\n| `<Switch>` | Removed | `<Routes>` |\n| `<Route component=\\|render=>` | Removed | `<Route element=>` |\n| `<Redirect>` | Removed | `<Navigate>` |\n| `withRouter` | Removed | hooks |\n| `match.params` | Removed | `useParams` |\n\n#### v6 APIs — Adoption Counts\n\n| v6 API (via compat) | Approx. File Count |\n|----------------------|--------------------|\n| `useParams` | ~55 files |\n| `<Routes>` | ~26 files |\n| `useNavigate` | ~25 files |\n| `useSearchParams` | ~11 files |\n| `<Navigate>` | ~6 files |\n| `<Route element=>` | ~2 files (centralized) |\n| `<Outlet>` | 0 files |\n\n---\n\n### What's Left to Complete the Migration\n\n```mermaid\ngraph LR\n    subgraph \"✅ Done\"\n        A[\"Component APIs\\n(useNavigate, Routes,\\nRoute element, Navigate,\\nuseParams, useSearchParams)\"]\n        B[\"Plugin API\\n(v6 exposed via compat\\nfor plugin authors)\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"⚠️ In Progress / Remaining\"\n        C[\"Root Router\\n(still v5 Router +\\nhistory v4)\"]\n        D[\"locationService\\n(wraps history v4,\\nnot v6 navigation)\"]\n        E[\"CompatRouter bridge\\n(needs removal once\\nfully on v6)\"]\n        F[\"Type definitions\\n(@types/react-router v5\\nstill installed)\"]\n        G[\"Direct v5 imports\\n(~4-6 files still import\\nfrom react-router-dom v5)\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"🔮 Not Started\"\n        H[\"Data Router APIs\\n(createBrowserRouter,\\nRouterProvider, loaders,\\nactions — v6.4+)\"]\n        I[\"Outlet-based\\nnested routing\"]\n    end\n\n    A -.->|completed| C\n    C -.->|blocks| E\n    C -.->|blocks| F\n    E -.->|blocks| H\n\n    style A fill:#66bb6a,stroke:#2e7d32,color:#fff\n    style B fill:#66bb6a,stroke:#2e7d32,color:#fff\n    style C fill:#ffa726,stroke:#e65100,color:#000\n    style D fill:#ffa726,stroke:#e65100,color:#000\n    style E fill:#ffa726,stroke:#e65100,color:#000\n    style F fill:#ffa726,stroke:#e65100,color:#000\n    style G fill:#ffa726,stroke:#e65100,color:#000\n    style H fill:#ef5350,stroke:#b71c1c,color:#fff\n    style I fill:#ef5350,stroke:#b71c1c,color:#fff\n```\n\n---\n\n### Remaining v5 Touchpoints\n\nThese files still import directly from `react-router-dom` (v5) rather than the compat package:\n\n| File | What it imports |\n|------|-----------------|\n| `public/app/routes/RoutesWrapper.tsx` | `Router` (the v5 root) |\n| `public/app/test/test-utils.tsx` | Test router setup |\n| `public/app/test/TestProvider.tsx` | Test router setup |\n| `public/app/features/explore/spec/helper/setup.tsx` | Test router setup |\n| `public/app/core/components/AppNotificationList.tsx` | `useLocation` |\n| `public/app/core/components/TabItemRenderer.tsx` | `useLocation` |\n\n---\n\n### The `locationService` Abstraction\n\nA significant factor in this migration is Grafana's `locationService` (`@grafana/runtime`). This wraps `history` v4 and is used extensively throughout the codebase for programmatic navigation instead of React Router's hooks directly. This abstraction:\n\n- **Helped** the migration by decoupling navigation calls from the router API\n- **Will need updating** to use v6's native navigation when the root router switches to v6\n- Is used in many files across the codebase (`locationService.push`, `locationService.replace`, `locationService.partial`)\n\n---\n\n### Migration Phases\n\n```mermaid\ngantt\n    title React Router Migration Phases\n    dateFormat YYYY\n    axisFormat %Y\n\n    section Phase 1 — Component APIs\n    Remove Switch, Redirect, useHistory           :done, p1a, 2023, 2024\n    Adopt Routes, Route element=, Navigate         :done, p1b, 2023, 2024\n    Adopt useNavigate, useParams, useSearchParams  :done, p1c, 2023, 2024\n\n    section Phase 2 — Compat Bridge\n    Install react-router-dom-v5-compat             :done, p2a, 2023, 2024\n    Wrap root with CompatRouter                    :done, p2b, 2023, 2024\n    Expose v6 to plugins via compat                :done, p2c, 2024, 2025\n\n    section Phase 3 — Root Migration (Remaining)\n    Remove v5 Router, adopt v6 BrowserRouter       :active, p3a, 2025, 2026\n    Update locationService to v6 navigation        :p3b, 2025, 2027\n    Remove CompatRouter bridge                     :p3c, 2026, 2027\n    Remove v5 dependencies and types               :p3d, 2026, 2027\n\n    section Phase 4 — v6.4+ Data Router (Future)\n    Adopt createBrowserRouter / RouterProvider      :p4a, 2027, 2028\n    Add loaders and actions                         :p4b, 2027, 2028\n    Adopt Outlet for nested routing                 :p4c, 2027, 2028\n```\n\n---\n\n### Key Observations\n\n1. **~95% of component-level migration is complete.** All v5-specific APIs (`useHistory`, `<Switch>`, `<Redirect>`, `withRouter`) have been fully removed from the codebase.\n\n2. **The compat bridge is working as intended.** `react-router-dom-v5-compat` allows v6 APIs to run on top of the v5 router, and the codebase is heavily using v6 hooks and components through it.\n\n3. **The root router is the main remaining v5 artifact.** The `<Router history={...}>` in `RoutesWrapper.tsx` still uses v5's `Router` with `history` v4. This is the critical piece that needs to change to fully move to v6.\n\n4. **`locationService` is a double-edged sword.** It abstracted away direct `history` usage (making API migration easier), but it itself is still backed by `history` v4 and will need reworking when the root router changes.\n\n5. **No v6.4+ data router patterns are in use.** `createBrowserRouter`, `RouterProvider`, loaders, actions, and `<Outlet>` are not adopted yet. These represent a potential future phase.\n\n6. **Plugin ecosystem is transitioning.** Grafana v10 started exposing v6 to plugins; v11 deprecated v5 for plugins. The `sharedDependencies.ts` remaps `react-router` to the compat package for plugin consumption.",
