  "text": "\nHere are the main files that power the Bookmarks page UI:\n\n---\n\n## Core page component\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| **`public/app/features/bookmarks/BookmarksPage.tsx`** | Main Bookmarks page. Renders either an empty state or a grid of `NavLandingPageCard` items from pinned URLs. |\n\n---\n\n## Data & state\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| **`public/app/core/components/AppChrome/MegaMenu/hooks.ts`** | `usePinnedItems()` – loads `bookmarkUrls` from user preferences via RTK Query. |\n| **`public/app/core/reducers/navBarTree.ts`** | `setBookmark` action – updates the nav tree when items are pinned/unpinned. |\n| **`public/app/core/components/AppChrome/MegaMenu/utils.ts`** | `findByUrl()` – finds a nav item by URL in the nav tree. |\n\n---\n\n## UI components\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| **`public/app/core/components/NavLandingPage/NavLandingPageCard.tsx`** | Card used for each bookmark (title, description, link). |\n| **`public/app/core/components/Page/Page.tsx`** | Page layout wrapper used by BookmarksPage. |\n| **`@grafana/ui` `EmptyState`** | Shown when there are no bookmarks. |\n\n---\n\n## Bookmark pinning (Mega Menu)\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| **`public/app/core/components/AppChrome/MegaMenu/MegaMenu.tsx`** | Renders the nav menu, populates the bookmarks section from `pinnedItems`, and handles `onPinItem` (add/remove bookmark). |\n| **`public/app/core/components/AppChrome/MegaMenu/MegaMenuItem.tsx`** | Individual nav item with bookmark icon. |\n\n---\n\n## Routing & i18n\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| **`public/app/routes/routes.tsx`** (lines 536–540) | Registers `/bookmarks` and lazy-loads `BookmarksPage`. |\n| **`public/locales/en-US/grafana.json`** | `bookmarks-page`, `nav.bookmarks`, `nav.bookmarks-empty` strings. |\n| **`public/app/core/utils/navBarItem-translations.ts`** | Translates nav item labels for `bookmarks` and `bookmarks-empty`. |\n\n---\n\n## Preferences & backend\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| **`public/app/core/components/SharedPreferences/SharedPreferences.tsx`** | Default `navbar.bookmarkUrls: []` in preferences. |\n| **`@grafana/api-clients/rtkq/legacy/preferences`** | `useGetUserPreferencesQuery` and `usePatchUserPreferencesMutation` for `bookmarkUrls`. |\n\n---\n\n## Flow summary\n\n1. **Data**: `usePinnedItems()` reads `navbar.bookmarkUrls` from user preferences.\n2. **Resolve items**: `findByUrl(navTree, url)` maps each URL to a nav item.\n3. **Render**: BookmarksPage shows either `EmptyState` or a grid of `NavLandingPageCard`.\n4. **Pinning**: MegaMenu’s `onPinItem` updates preferences and dispatches `setBookmark`.",
