  "text": "\nThe bookmarks page has 4 categories:\n\n1. **All** — shows all bookmarks\n2. **Operations** — includes:\n   - alerting\n   - connections\n   - explore\n   - drilldown\n   - infrastructure\n   - observability\n   - alerts-and-incidents\n   - testing-and-synthetics\n\n3. **Admin** — includes:\n   - cfg (configuration)\n   - cfg/general\n   - cfg/plugins\n   - cfg/access\n   - profile\n\n4. **Content** — includes:\n   - dashboards/browse\n   - starred\n   - reports\n   - apps\n   - home\n\nBookmarks are assigned to a category based on their parent navigation section. If a bookmark doesn't match a known section, it defaults to \"Content\". The page displays collapsible sections for each category, and you can filter by category using the radio button group at the top.",
