  "model": "composer-1.5",
  "text": "\nHere’s an overview of the files that power the Bookmarks UI:\n\n---\n\n## Core page component\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| **`public/app/features/bookmarks/BookmarksPage.tsx`** | Main Bookmarks page. Renders either an empty state or a grid of `NavLandingPageCard` items from pinned URLs. Uses `usePinnedItems()` and `findByUrl()` to build the list. |\n\n---\n\n## Routing\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| **`public/app/routes/routes.tsx`** (lines 536–541) | Registers the `/bookmarks` route and lazy-loads `BookmarksPage`. |\n\n---\n\n## Data & state\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| **`public/app/core/components/AppChrome/MegaMenu/hooks.ts`** | `usePinnedItems()` – loads `bookmarkUrls` from user preferences via RTK Query (`useGetUserPreferencesQuery`). |\n| **`public/app/core/reducers/navBarTree.ts`** | `setBookmark` action – updates the nav tree when items are pinned/unpinned. |\n| **`public/app/core/components/AppChrome/MegaMenu/utils.ts`** | `findByUrl()` – finds a nav item by URL in the nav tree. |\n\n---\n\n## UI components\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| **`public/app/core/components/NavLandingPage/NavLandingPageCard.tsx`** | Card used for each bookmark (title, description, link). Supports optional `category` for styling. |\n| **`public/app/core/components/Page/Page.tsx`** | Layout wrapper (`Page`, `Page.Contents`) used by the Bookmarks page. |\n| **`public/app/core/components/AppChrome/MegaMenu/MegaMenuItemText.tsx`** | Renders the bookmark icon button on nav items (Add/Remove from Bookmarks). Hides the bookmark icon on the Bookmarks page itself. |\n| **`public/app/core/components/AppChrome/MegaMenu/MegaMenu.tsx`** | Populates the bookmark section in the mega menu and handles pin/unpin via `onPinItem` and `patchPreferences`. |\n\n---\n\n## Translations & nav labels\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| **`public/locales/en-US/grafana.json`** | `bookmarks-page.empty.message`, `bookmarks-page.empty.tip`, `nav.bookmarks.title`, `nav.bookmarks-empty.title`, `navigation.item.add-bookmark`, `navigation.item.remove-bookmark`. |\n| **`public/app/core/utils/navBarItem-translations.ts`** | `getNavTitle()` for `bookmarks` and `bookmarks-empty` nav item labels. |\n\n---\n\n## Data flow\n\n1. **Persistence:** `bookmarkUrls` stored in user preferences via `preferences.navbar.bookmarkUrls`.\n2. **Pinning:** `MegaMenu.tsx` → `onPinItem` → `patchPreferences` (API) → `setBookmark` (Redux).\n3. **Reading:** `BookmarksPage` → `usePinnedItems()` (RTK Query) → `findByUrl(navTree, url)` for each URL → `NavLandingPageCard` for each item.\n\n---\n\n## Suggested files to edit for UI changes\n\n- **Layout, empty state, grid:** `BookmarksPage.tsx`\n- **Card styling:** `NavLandingPageCard.tsx`\n- **Bookmark icon in nav:** `MegaMenuItemText.tsx`\n- **Pagination, filtering, grouping:** `BookmarksPage.tsx` (and possibly `NavLandingPageCard.tsx`\n- **Translations:** `public/locales/en-US/grafana.json` (and other locales)",
