  "model": "claude-4.6-opus-high-thinking",
  "text": "No lint errors. Here's a summary of what was added to `BookmarksPage.tsx`:\n\n**Category system** -- Each bookmark is automatically assigned to one of three categories based on its position in Grafana's nav tree:\n\n- **Operations** -- Alerting, Explore, Drilldown, Infrastructure, Observability, Connections, Testing & Synthetics, Adaptive Telemetry\n- **Admin** -- Configuration (`cfg`), Admin, Help\n- **Content** -- Dashboards, Apps, Reports, and everything else (default fallback)\n\nThe categorization works by resolving the bookmark's URL to the top-level nav tree section it belongs to via `getSectionIdForUrl`, then mapping that section ID to a category.\n\n**Filtering and grouping UI** using existing Grafana UI components:\n\n- `FilterInput` at the top for text search across bookmark names and subtitles\n- `FilterPill` row for quick category filtering (\"All\", \"Operations\", \"Admin\", \"Content\") -- follows the same pattern as `TransformationPickerNg`\n- `CollapsableSection` groups when \"All\" is selected, showing each populated category as a collapsible section with the card grid inside\n- When a specific category pill is selected, shows a flat grid of just that category's items\n- `EmptyState` with `variant=\"not-found\"` when filters produce no results",
