  "model": "claude-4.6-opus-high-thinking",
  "text": "Here's a comprehensive update on the React Router API migration in the Grafana codebase.\n\n---\n\n## React Router Migration Status\n\n### Current State: V5 Core + V6 APIs via Compat Layer\n\nGrafana is in a **transitional state** — the root router is still React Router **v5** (`react-router-dom@5.3.4`), but nearly all application code has been migrated to use **v6-style APIs** through the `react-router-dom-v5-compat@^6.26.1` compatibility package. This is the officially recommended incremental migration path from the React Router team.\n\n```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    subgraph \"Current Architecture\"\n        RRv5[\"react-router-dom v5.3.4<br/>(Root Router)\"]\n        Compat[\"react-router-dom-v5-compat ^6.26.1<br/>(Bridge Layer)\"]\n        LocSvc[\"locationService<br/>(Grafana Abstraction)\"]\n        HistV4[\"history v4.10.1\"]\n        AppCode[\"Application Code<br/>(~152 files)\"]\n    end\n\n    HistV4 --> LocSvc\n    LocSvc -->|\"getHistory()\"| RRv5\n    RRv5 -->|\"<CompatRouter>\"| Compat\n    Compat -->|\"v6 APIs\"| AppCode\n```\n\n### Deprecated v5 APIs — Fully Removed\n\nAll legacy React Router v5 APIs have been successfully eliminated from the application code:\n\n| Deprecated API | Status | Replacement |\n|---|---|---|\n| `useHistory` | **Removed** (0 RR imports) | `useNavigate` or `locationService` |\n| `withRouter` | **Removed** (0 uses) | Hooks-based approach |\n| `<Switch>` | **Removed** (0 uses) | `<Routes>` |\n| `<Redirect>` | **Removed** (0 uses) | `<Navigate>` |\n| `RouteComponentProps` | **Partially remaining** via `GrafanaRouteComponentProps` (~20 files) | `useParams`, `useLocation`, `useSearchParams` |\n\n```mermaid\ngraph LR\n    subgraph \"V5 APIs — Migration Complete ✓\"\n        useHistory[\"useHistory → useNavigate\"]\n        withRouter[\"withRouter → hooks\"]\n        Switch[\"Switch → Routes\"]\n        Redirect[\"Redirect → Navigate\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"Remaining Work\"\n        GRP[\"GrafanaRouteComponentProps<br/>(~20 page components)\"]\n        RootRouter[\"V5 Root Router<br/>(RoutesWrapper.tsx)\"]\n        LocSvc2[\"locationService<br/>(history v4 dependency)\"]\n        Stragglers[\"4 non-compat imports\"]\n    end\n```\n\n### V6 API Adoption\n\nThe modern v6-style APIs are well-adopted across the codebase, all imported from `react-router-dom-v5-compat`:\n\n| V6 API | File Count | Notes |\n|---|---|---|\n| `useParams` | ~45 files | Widely adopted |\n| `useLocation` | ~35 files | Widely adopted |\n| `useNavigate` | ~25 files | Growing adoption |\n| `<Routes>` / `<Route>` | ~22 files | Main app + tests |\n| `<Navigate>` | ~15 files | Redirect replacement |\n| `useSearchParams` | 7 files | Query param management |\n| `<Link>` | 3 files | Direct router links |\n| `Outlet` | 0 | Not yet adopted |\n| `createBrowserRouter` | 0 | Not yet adopted |\n| `RouterProvider` | 0 | Not yet adopted |\n\n### What Remains for Full V6 Migration\n\n```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    subgraph \"Phase 1 — Done\"\n        A1[Remove useHistory] --> A2[Remove withRouter]\n        A2 --> A3[Replace Switch with Routes]\n        A3 --> A4[Replace Redirect with Navigate]\n        A4 --> A5[Adopt v6 hooks via compat]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"Phase 2 — In Progress\"\n        B1[Migrate GrafanaRouteComponentProps<br/>~20 page components]\n        B2[Fix 4 straggler non-compat imports]\n        B3[Plugin ecosystem v6 migration]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"Phase 3 — Future\"\n        C1[Drop CompatRouter bridge]\n        C2[Upgrade root Router to v6]\n        C3[Adopt Data Router APIs<br/>createBrowserRouter / RouterProvider]\n        C4[Migrate locationService off history v4]\n    end\n\n    A5 --> B1\n    A5 --> B2\n    A5 --> B3\n    B1 --> C1\n    B2 --> C1\n    B3 --> C1\n    C1 --> C2\n    C2 --> C3\n    C2 --> C4\n```\n\n### Straggler Files (4 Non-Compat Imports)\n\nThese files still import from `react-router-dom` or `react-router` directly instead of through the compat layer:\n\n| File | Current Import Source | API Used |\n|---|---|---|\n| `AppNotificationList.tsx` | `react-router-dom` | `useLocation` |\n| `RepositoryStatusPage.tsx` | `react-router` | `useLocation` |\n| `FileStatusPage.tsx` | `react-router` | `useLocation` |\n| `TabItemRenderer.tsx` | `react-router` | `useLocation` |\n\n### The `locationService` Abstraction\n\nGrafana wraps React Router behind its own `locationService` singleton (defined in `@grafana/runtime`). This is used in **~150+ files** and provides imperative navigation (`push`, `replace`, `partial`) built on `history` v4. This abstraction will eventually need to be adapted when migrating to the v6 data router pattern (`createBrowserRouter`), since the data router manages its own history internally.\n\n```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    subgraph \"Navigation Patterns\"\n        Hooks[\"React Router Hooks<br/>useNavigate, useParams, useLocation\"]\n        LocSvc[\"locationService<br/>push / replace / partial\"]\n        HistV4[\"history v4<br/>createBrowserHistory\"]\n        RouterV5[\"React Router v5<br/>Router component\"]\n    end\n\n    Hooks -->|\"via compat layer\"| RouterV5\n    LocSvc -->|\"wraps\"| HistV4\n    HistV4 -->|\"passed to\"| RouterV5\n\n    style LocSvc fill:#fff3cd\n    style HistV4 fill:#fff3cd\n```\n\nThe yellow-highlighted items (`locationService` and `history v4`) represent the key coupling that blocks a full v6 data router migration.\n\n### Plugin Ecosystem\n\n- **V10 (Grafana 10.0):** App plugins gained the ability to use React Router v6\n- **V11 (Grafana 11.0):** React Router v5 was officially deprecated for plugins\n- **Shared dependencies:** The plugin loader still provides both `react-router-dom` (v5) and `react-router-dom-v5-compat` to plugins for backward compatibility\n- **E2E test plugins** already use `react-router-dom@^6.22.0` natively\n\n### Summary\n\nThe migration is **well advanced through Phase 1** — all deprecated v5 APIs (`useHistory`, `withRouter`, `Switch`, `Redirect`) have been removed from application code. The codebase is primarily operating on v6 APIs via the compat bridge (~152 files). The main remaining work is cleaning up `GrafanaRouteComponentProps` usage (~20 page components), fixing 4 straggler imports, and eventually removing the compat layer to run on a native v6 router with data router APIs.",
