  "text": "All lints are clean and the implementation is complete. Here's a summary of what was added:\n\n**Category system** -- Three categories are defined: **Operations** (alerting, explore, monitoring, connections, datasources, etc.), **Admin** (users, teams, orgs, plugins, server settings, etc.), and **Content** (dashboards, playlists, library panels, etc.).\n\n**Categorization logic** (`categorizeItem`) -- Each bookmark is assigned a category using a three-tier approach:\n1. Direct match on the nav item's `id`\n2. Walk up the `parentItem` chain to match ancestor IDs\n3. Fall back to URL prefix matching\n4. Default to \"Content\" if nothing matches\n\n**Filter bar** -- Uses `FilterPill` components (same pattern as `TraceFilterPills`) in a horizontal `Stack`. Each pill shows the category name and count. When no pills are selected, all categories are shown. Selecting one or more pills filters to just those categories.\n\n**Grouped rendering** -- Bookmarks are rendered in labeled sections, each with a `Text` heading and the existing card grid layout underneath. Only non-empty categories that pass the active filter are shown.\n\n**i18n** -- All user-facing strings use `t()` for translation, following existing patterns. The `FilterPill` label uses interpolation for the dynamic category name and count.",
