  "text": "Here are the key files involved in the bookmarks page UI, grouped by responsibility:\n\n### Core Page Component\n\n- **`public/app/features/bookmarks/BookmarksPage.tsx`** -- The main bookmarks page. Renders a grid of `NavLandingPageCard` components for each bookmarked item. Shows an empty state when no bookmarks exist. Uses `usePinnedItems()` for the list of bookmark URLs.\n\n### Routing\n\n- **`public/app/routes/routes.tsx`** (around line 535) -- Registers the `/bookmarks` route with a lazy-loaded `BookmarksPage`.\n\n### Mega Menu / Sidebar Integration\n\n- **`public/app/core/components/AppChrome/MegaMenu/MegaMenu.tsx`** -- Locates the `id === 'bookmarks'` nav item and populates its children from pinned items. Dispatches `setBookmark` to toggle bookmarks.\n- **`public/app/core/components/AppChrome/MegaMenu/MegaMenuItemText.tsx`** -- Renders the bookmark toggle icon on each nav item (\"Add to Bookmarks\" / \"Remove from Bookmarks\").\n- **`public/app/core/components/AppChrome/MegaMenu/hooks.ts`** -- `usePinnedItems()` hook that exposes `preferences.data?.navbar?.bookmarkUrls`.\n- **`public/app/core/components/AppChrome/MegaMenu/utils.ts`** -- Utility functions like `itemIsBookmarked` and `isInBookmarksSection`.\n\n### State Management\n\n- **`public/app/core/reducers/navBarTree.ts`** -- Contains the `setBookmark` Redux reducer that adds/removes items from `bookmarks.children` in the nav tree.\n\n### User Preferences & Schema\n\n- **`public/app/core/components/SharedPreferences/SharedPreferences.tsx`** -- Defines default `navbar: { bookmarkUrls: [] }` for new users.\n- **`packages/grafana-schema/src/raw/preferences/x/preferences_types.gen.ts`** -- TypeScript types for `bookmarkUrls: Array<string>`.\n\n### Translations\n\n- **`public/app/core/utils/navBarItem-translations.ts`** -- Translation keys for `nav.bookmarks.title` (\"Bookmarks\") and the empty-state message.\n\n### Tests\n\n- **`e2e-playwright/various-suite/bookmarks.spec.ts`** -- End-to-end Playwright tests for the bookmarks page.\n- **`public/app/core/components/AppChrome/MegaMenu/utils.test.ts`** -- Unit tests for the mega menu bookmark utilities.\n\n### Data Flow Summary\n\n1. Bookmark URLs are persisted in user preferences (`navbar.bookmarkUrls`).\n2. The `navBarTree` Redux reducer keeps `bookmarks.children` in sync.\n3. The mega menu reads this state to show bookmark controls and inject children.\n4. The `/bookmarks` page uses `usePinnedItems()` and `findByUrl` to resolve nav items and render `NavLandingPageCard` components.\n\nThe most likely starting point for UI changes is `BookmarksPage.tsx` for the page itself, `MegaMenuItemText.tsx` for the bookmark toggle interaction, and `navBarTree.ts` if you need to change how bookmarks are stored/managed.",
