[2026-03-16 14:38:54] afterAgentResponse
{
  "conversation_id": "1a4b71dd-fcf2-4f14-9a8c-9f65681431e7",
  "generation_id": "3618b79b-0426-48e2-9796-20cecead8251",
  "model": "claude-4.6-opus-high-thinking",
  "text": "# React Router Migration Overview — Grafana\n\n## Current State: Mid-Migration (v5 → v6 via Compat Layer)\n\nGrafana is partway through migrating from **React Router v5** to **v6**. Rather than a big-bang rewrite, the team uses the official **`react-router-dom-v5-compat`** bridge package, which exposes v6 APIs on top of a v5 runtime. Legacy v5 component APIs (`Switch`, `Redirect`, `withRouter`, `RouteComponentProps`) have been fully removed; the remaining v5 footprint is the **root `<Router>`** and the **`history` v4 instance** powering `locationService`.\n\n### Package Versions\n\n| Package | Version | Role |\n|---------|---------|------|\n| `react-router` | 5.3.4 | v5 core (still the runtime) |\n| `react-router-dom` | 5.3.4 | v5 DOM bindings (root Router) |\n| `react-router-dom-v5-compat` | ^6.26.1 | Bridge — v6 API surface on v5 |\n| `history` | 4.10.1 | Drives `locationService` |\n\n---\n\n## Architecture\n\n```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    subgraph \"Root (still v5)\"\n        A[\"Router (v5)<br/>history = locationService.getHistory()\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"Bridge Layer\"\n        B[\"CompatRouter<br/>(react-router-dom-v5-compat)\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"App Shell\"\n        C[LocationServiceProvider]\n        D[AppChrome]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"Routes (v6-style)\"\n        E[\"&lt;Routes&gt;\"]\n        F[\"&lt;Route element={...} /&gt;\"]\n        G[GrafanaRouteWrapper]\n        H[Page Component]\n    end\n\n    A --> C --> B --> D --> E --> F --> G --> H\n```\n\nThe key insight: the **outer shell is v5** (the `<Router>` component from `react-router-dom` using `history` v4), while **everything inside** uses v6-style APIs via the compat bridge.\n\n---\n\n## Navigation Architecture\n\nGrafana doesn't rely solely on React Router for navigation. It has a custom **`locationService`** abstraction that sits between the app and the `history` library:\n\n```mermaid\ngraph LR\n    subgraph \"Navigation Sources\"\n        A[useNavigate hook]\n        B[\"locationService.push()\"]\n        C[\"locationService.partial()\"]\n        D[Link component]\n        E[interceptLinkClicks]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"Abstraction Layer\"\n        F[\"locationService<br/>(HistoryWrapper)\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"Runtime\"\n        G[\"history v4<br/>(BrowserHistory)\"]\n        H[\"Router (v5)\"]\n    end\n\n    A --> G\n    B --> F --> G --> H\n    C --> F\n    D --> G\n    E --> F\n```\n\n- **~200+ files** use `locationService.push/replace/partial` directly\n- **~20 files** use `useNavigate()` from the compat package\n- **Link clicks** on `<a>` tags are intercepted and routed through `locationService`\n\n---\n\n## Migration Progress\n\n```mermaid\npie title Import Source Distribution (~170 files)\n    \"react-router-dom-v5-compat (v6 API)\" : 130\n    \"locationService (custom)\" : 35\n    \"react-router-dom (v5 — infra only)\" : 4\n    \"react-router (bare — stragglers)\" : 3\n```\n\n### What's been migrated\n\n| Area | Status |\n|------|--------|\n| `<Switch>` → `<Routes>` | Done |\n| `<Redirect>` → `<Navigate>` | Done |\n| `component={...}` → `element={...}` on `<Route>` | Done |\n| `withRouter` HOC removed | Done |\n| `RouteComponentProps` → `GrafanaRouteComponentProps` | Done |\n| `useHistory` → `useNavigate` | Done (no React Router `useHistory` remains) |\n| `useParams`, `useLocation`, `useSearchParams` via compat | Done |\n\n### What remains (v5 footprint)\n\n| Area | Status | Files |\n|------|--------|-------|\n| Root `<Router>` from `react-router-dom` v5 | Still v5 | `RoutesWrapper.tsx`, test utilities |\n| `history` v4 instance | Still v4 | `locationService` in `@grafana/runtime` |\n| `CompatRouter` bridge | Still needed | `RoutesWrapper.tsx` |\n| `locationService` abstraction | Custom, not React Router | ~200+ files |\n| Straggler imports from `react-router` | 3-4 files | `RepositoryStatusPage`, `FileStatusPage`, `TabItemRenderer`, `AppNotificationList` |\n\n---\n\n## Plugin Compatibility Strategy\n\nGrafana exposes router packages to plugins with a clever aliasing trick in `public/app/features/plugins/loader/sharedDependencies.ts`:\n\n```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    subgraph \"Plugin imports\"\n        A[\"import from 'react-router-dom'\"]\n        B[\"import from 'react-router'\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"What they receive\"\n        C[\"react-router-dom v5<br/>(legacy plugins keep working)\"]\n        D[\"react-router-dom-v5-compat<br/>(v6 API surface)\"]\n    end\n\n    A --> C\n    B --> D\n```\n\nThis means:\n- **Existing plugins** importing `react-router-dom` still get v5 and keep working\n- **Plugins upgrading** to import from `react-router` get the v6 API surface via the compat package\n- Both can coexist in the same app without duplicate router instances\n\n---\n\n## What a Full v6 Migration Would Require\n\nTo complete the migration and drop `react-router-dom-v5-compat`:\n\n```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    A[\"Drop v5 Router\"] --> B[\"Replace history v4<br/>with v6 data router\"]\n    B --> C[\"createBrowserRouter /<br/>RouterProvider\"]\n    C --> D[\"Adopt Outlet for<br/>nested routes\"]\n    D --> E[\"Migrate locationService<br/>to v6 navigate()\"]\n    E --> F[\"Update plugin<br/>shared dependencies\"]\n    F --> G[\"Remove compat package\"]\n\n    style A fill:#ff9999\n    style B fill:#ff9999\n    style C fill:#ffcc99\n    style D fill:#ffcc99\n    style E fill:#ff9999\n    style F fill:#ffcc99\n    style G fill:#99ff99\n```\n\nThe hardest parts (in red) are:\n1. **Replacing the root `<Router>`** — the v5 `Router` accepts a `history` instance; v6's `createBrowserRouter` manages its own\n2. **Migrating `locationService`** — it's deeply embedded (~200+ files) and provides Grafana-specific features like `partial()` for query param updates and an observable location stream\n3. **Plugin compatibility** — must ensure plugins continue working through the transition\n\n---\n\n## Key Files\n\n| File | Role |\n|------|------|\n| `public/app/routes/RoutesWrapper.tsx` | Root router setup (`Router` + `CompatRouter`) |\n| `public/app/AppWrapper.tsx` | Route rendering with `<Routes>` / `<Route element>` |\n| `public/app/routes/routes.tsx` | All route definitions (`getAppRoutes()`) |\n| `public/app/core/navigation/types.ts` | `GrafanaRouteComponentProps` type |\n| `packages/grafana-runtime/src/services/LocationService.tsx` | `locationService` implementation |\n| `public/app/features/plugins/loader/sharedDependencies.ts` | Plugin router aliasing |\n| `public/app/core/navigation/patch/interceptLinkClicks.ts` | Link click interception |",
