  "text": "Here's a comprehensive overview of the React Router migration status in the Grafana codebase.\n\n## Current State\n\nGrafana is **mid-migration** from React Router v5 to v6. The approach uses `react-router-dom-v5-compat` as a bridge layer — the root router is still v5, but nearly all component-level code has been migrated to v6-style APIs.\n\n### Dependencies\n\n| Package | Version | Role |\n|---------|---------|------|\n| `react-router` | 5.3.4 | v5 core (still installed) |\n| `react-router-dom` | 5.3.4 | v5 DOM bindings (root router) |\n| `react-router-dom-v5-compat` | ^6.26.1 | Bridge layer providing v6 APIs on top of v5 |\n| `history` | 4.10.1 | v4 history (used by `LocationService`) |\n\n---\n\n## Migration Progress Diagrams\n\n### Overall Architecture\n\n```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    subgraph \"Current Routing Stack\"\n        A[\"v5 Router<br/>(react-router-dom 5.3.4)\"] --> B[\"CompatRouter<br/>(react-router-dom-v5-compat)\"]\n        B --> C[\"v6-style Routes & Route<br/>(via compat layer)\"]\n        C --> D[\"GrafanaRouteWrapper<br/>(renders route.component)\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"Navigation Layer\"\n        E[\"LocationService<br/>(@grafana/runtime)\"] --> F[\"history v4<br/>(createBrowserHistory)\"]\n        F --> A\n    end\n\n    style A fill:#f9a825,stroke:#f57f17,color:#000\n    style B fill:#fff59d,stroke:#f9a825,color:#000\n    style C fill:#a5d6a7,stroke:#388e3c,color:#000\n    style D fill:#a5d6a7,stroke:#388e3c,color:#000\n    style E fill:#f9a825,stroke:#f57f17,color:#000\n    style F fill:#f9a825,stroke:#f57f17,color:#000\n```\n\n### API Migration Status\n\n```mermaid\npie title \"v5 API Elimination\"\n    \"Migrated to v6 (via compat)\" : 100\n    \"Remaining v5 APIs\" : 0\n```\n\nAll legacy v5 component APIs have been removed:\n\n| v5 API | Status |\n|--------|--------|\n| `useHistory` | Removed (0 files) |\n| `useRouteMatch` | Removed (0 files) |\n| `<Switch>` | Removed (0 files) |\n| `<Route component={...}>` | Removed (0 files) |\n| `withRouter` | Removed (0 files) |\n| `RouteComponentProps` | Replaced with `GrafanaRouteComponentProps` |\n\n### Import Source Distribution\n\n```mermaid\npie title \"Import Sources (by file count)\"\n    \"react-router-dom-v5-compat (152 files)\" : 152\n    \"locationService custom abstraction (175 files)\" : 175\n    \"react-router-dom v5 direct (6 files)\" : 6\n    \"react-router v5 direct (3 files)\" : 3\n```\n\n### v6 API Adoption\n\n```mermaid\nbar chart\n    title \"v6 API Usage (file count)\"\n    \"useLocation\" : 57\n    \"useParams\" : 54\n    \"Routes component\" : 26\n    \"useNavigate\" : 24\n    \"Route element=\" : 20\n    \"useSearchParams\" : 10\n    \"Outlet\" : 0\n    \"useMatch\" : 0\n```\n\n### Migration Phases\n\n```mermaid\ngraph LR\n    subgraph \"Phase 1 — DONE\"\n        A1[\"Remove useHistory\"] --> A2[\"Remove Switch\"]\n        A2 --> A3[\"Remove withRouter\"]\n        A3 --> A4[\"Remove Route component=\"]\n        A4 --> A5[\"Adopt v6 hooks via compat\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"Phase 2 — CURRENT\"\n        B1[\"CompatRouter bridge active\"]\n        B2[\"152 files on compat imports\"]\n        B3[\"6 files still import react-router-dom v5\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"Phase 3 — TODO\"\n        C1[\"Replace root v5 Router<br/>with v6 BrowserRouter\"]\n        C2[\"Migrate LocationService<br/>to v6 router/history\"]\n        C3[\"Switch compat imports<br/>to react-router-dom v6\"]\n        C4[\"Adopt data router<br/>(createBrowserRouter, Outlet)\"]\n    end\n\n    A5 --> B1\n    B2 --> C3\n    B1 --> C1\n\n    style A1 fill:#a5d6a7,stroke:#388e3c,color:#000\n    style A2 fill:#a5d6a7,stroke:#388e3c,color:#000\n    style A3 fill:#a5d6a7,stroke:#388e3c,color:#000\n    style A4 fill:#a5d6a7,stroke:#388e3c,color:#000\n    style A5 fill:#a5d6a7,stroke:#388e3c,color:#000\n    style B1 fill:#fff59d,stroke:#f9a825,color:#000\n    style B2 fill:#fff59d,stroke:#f9a825,color:#000\n    style B3 fill:#fff59d,stroke:#f9a825,color:#000\n    style C1 fill:#ef9a9a,stroke:#c62828,color:#000\n    style C2 fill:#ef9a9a,stroke:#c62828,color:#000\n    style C3 fill:#ef9a9a,stroke:#c62828,color:#000\n    style C4 fill:#ef9a9a,stroke:#c62828,color:#000\n```\n\n---\n\n## Summary\n\n**What's done (Phase 1):** All v5 component-level APIs (`useHistory`, `<Switch>`, `withRouter`, `<Route component={}>`, `RouteComponentProps`) have been fully removed. This is the hardest, most labor-intensive part of the migration.\n\n**Where we are (Phase 2):** The app runs on a **hybrid stack** — v5 `<Router>` at the root with `<CompatRouter>` bridging to v6-style APIs. ~152 files import from `react-router-dom-v5-compat`, and ~175 files use the custom `locationService` abstraction. Only 9 files still import directly from the v5 packages.\n\n**What's left (Phase 3):**\n1. **Replace the root v5 `<Router>`** in `RoutesWrapper.tsx` with v6's `BrowserRouter` or `RouterProvider`\n2. **Migrate `LocationService`** away from `history` v4 to align with v6's built-in navigation\n3. **Swap all `react-router-dom-v5-compat` imports** to `react-router-dom` v6 (mostly mechanical)\n4. **Optionally adopt the data router** pattern (`createBrowserRouter`, `<Outlet>`) for nested routing\n\nThe migration is roughly **60-70% complete** by effort — the consumer-side API migration (the hard part) is done, but the infrastructure swap (root router + `LocationService`) and the final import cleanup remain.",
