  "model": "claude-4.6-opus-max-thinking-fast",
  "text": "Here's a comprehensive overview of the React Router migration status in Grafana.\n\n## Current State: Hybrid v5/v6\n\nGrafana is running **React Router v5 (5.3.4)** at the root, with most component-level code using **v6-style APIs** through the `react-router-dom-v5-compat` bridge (^6.26.1).\n\n### Architecture Overview\n\n```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    subgraph \"Root Layer — Still v5\"\n        A[\"Router (v5)<br/>react-router-dom 5.3.4\"] --> B[\"CompatRouter<br/>react-router-dom-v5-compat\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"App Layer — v6 APIs via Compat\"\n        B --> C[\"Routes / Route element={}\"]\n        C --> D[\"GrafanaRouteWrapper<br/>useLocation, useParams, Navigate\"]\n        D --> E[\"Feature Pages\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"Navigation Abstraction\"\n        F[\"LocationService<br/>wraps history v4\"] -.->|\"push/replace/partial\"| A\n        E -.->|\"~200+ files use\"| F\n    end\n\n    style A fill:#f9a825,stroke:#f57f17,color:#000\n    style B fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f9a825,color:#000\n    style C fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#388e3c,color:#000\n    style D fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#388e3c,color:#000\n    style E fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#388e3c,color:#000\n    style F fill:#f9a825,stroke:#f57f17,color:#000\n```\n\n### Import Source Distribution\n\n~129 files import from the compat layer, ~6 from v5 directly, and ~200+ use `locationService`:\n\n```mermaid\npie title Import Sources Across the Codebase\n    \"react-router-dom-v5-compat (v6 APIs)\" : 129\n    \"react-router-dom (v5 direct)\" : 6\n    \"react-router (v5 core)\" : 3\n```\n\n### Migration Progress by Category\n\n```mermaid\ngraph LR\n    subgraph \"Done\"\n        A1[\"Route definitions<br/>Routes + Route element={}\"]\n        A2[\"Component hooks<br/>useNavigate, useParams,<br/>useLocation via compat\"]\n        A3[\"Redirects<br/>Navigate replaces Redirect\"]\n        A4[\"HOC removal<br/>withRouter eliminated\"]\n        A5[\"Switch removal<br/>Replaced by Routes\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"In Progress\"\n        B1[\"Root Router<br/>Still v5 Router +<br/>history prop\"]\n        B2[\"Stray v5 imports<br/>~6 files still import<br/>from react-router-dom\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"Not Started\"\n        C1[\"LocationService<br/>Still wraps history v4<br/>~200+ files depend on it\"]\n        C2[\"Data Router APIs<br/>createBrowserRouter,<br/>RouterProvider, loaders\"]\n    end\n\n    style A1 fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#388e3c,color:#000\n    style A2 fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#388e3c,color:#000\n    style A3 fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#388e3c,color:#000\n    style A4 fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#388e3c,color:#000\n    style A5 fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#388e3c,color:#000\n    style B1 fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f9a825,color:#000\n    style B2 fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f9a825,color:#000\n    style C1 fill:#ffcdd2,stroke:#c62828,color:#000\n    style C2 fill:#ffcdd2,stroke:#c62828,color:#000\n```\n\n### Key Remaining Blockers\n\n```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    subgraph \"Blocker Chain\"\n        L[\"LocationService<br/>packages/grafana-runtime\"] -->|wraps| H[\"history v4\"]\n        H -->|provides history to| R[\"v5 Router<br/>RoutesWrapper.tsx\"]\n        R -->|\"must stay v5 until<br/>LocationService migrates\"| V6[\"Full v6 Router\"]\n        V6 -->|\"enables\"| DR[\"Data Router APIs<br/>loaders, actions\"]\n    end\n\n    style L fill:#ffcdd2,stroke:#c62828,color:#000\n    style H fill:#ffcdd2,stroke:#c62828,color:#000\n    style R fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f9a825,color:#000\n    style V6 fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1565c0,color:#000\n    style DR fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1565c0,color:#000\n```\n\n### Summary\n\n| Area | Status | Details |\n|------|--------|---------|\n| Route definitions | Done | `<Routes>` + `<Route element={}>` throughout |\n| Component hooks | Done | ~129 files use v6 hooks via compat |\n| `withRouter` / `Switch` / `Redirect` | Done | Fully removed |\n| Root router | In progress | Still `<Router history={}>` from v5 |\n| Direct v5 imports | In progress | ~6 files (mostly test infra) |\n| `LocationService` | Not started | ~200+ files depend on `history` v4 wrapper |\n| Data router (`createBrowserRouter`) | Not started | Blocked by above |\n\nThe component-level migration is essentially complete -- the remaining work is infrastructural: replacing the v5 root `Router` and migrating `LocationService` away from `history` v4. That's the hard part, since `locationService` is deeply embedded across ~200+ files and is the primary navigation mechanism in the app.",
