  "model": "claude-4.6-opus-high-thinking",
  "text": "Here's a comprehensive overview of the React Router migration in the Grafana codebase.\n\n---\n\n## React Router Migration Overview\n\nGrafana is migrating from **React Router v5** to **React Router v6** using an **incremental compat-layer approach**. The migration is roughly **~95% complete at the component level**, but the core routing infrastructure (root router, `LocationService`) still runs on v5.\n\n### Package Landscape\n\n| Package | Version | Role |\n|---------|---------|------|\n| `react-router` | 5.3.4 | v5 core (still in use) |\n| `react-router-dom` | 5.3.4 | v5 DOM bindings (root router) |\n| `react-router-dom-v5-compat` | ^6.26.1 | v6 API bridge on top of v5 |\n| `history` | 4.10.1 | Used by v5 router + `LocationService` |\n\nNo feature flags control this migration -- it is a progressive, file-by-file shift.\n\n---\n\n### Current Router Bootstrap Architecture\n\n```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    A[\"app.ts (GrafanaApp.init)\"] --> B[\"AppWrapper\"]\n    B --> C[\"RoutesWrapper.tsx\"]\n    C --> D[\"v5 Router\\n(history from locationService)\"]\n    D --> E[\"LocationServiceProvider\"]\n    E --> F[\"CompatRouter\\n(v5-compat bridge)\"]\n    F --> G[\"AppChrome\"]\n    G --> H[\"v6-style Routes\"]\n    H --> I[\"Route element=GrafanaRouteWrapper\"]\n    I --> J[\"GrafanaRoute\\n(auth, keybindings, Suspense)\"]\n    J --> K[\"Page Component\"]\n\n    style D fill:#f9a825,stroke:#f57f17,color:#000\n    style F fill:#f9a825,stroke:#f57f17,color:#000\n    style H fill:#66bb6a,stroke:#2e7d32,color:#000\n    style I fill:#66bb6a,stroke:#2e7d32,color:#000\n```\n\nYellow = still v5 infrastructure, Green = already using v6 patterns.\n\n---\n\n### Dependency Chain\n\n```mermaid\ngraph LR\n    subgraph \"v5 Layer (to be replaced)\"\n        RRD5[\"react-router-dom 5.3.4\"]\n        RR5[\"react-router 5.3.4\"]\n        H4[\"history 4.10.1\"]\n        LS[\"LocationService\\n(HistoryWrapper)\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"Compat Bridge\"\n        COMPAT[\"react-router-dom-v5-compat\\n6.26.1+\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"App Code (~130+ files)\"\n        HOOKS[\"useNavigate\\nuseParams\\nuseLocation\\nuseSearchParams\"]\n        COMPONENTS[\"Routes\\nRoute element=...\\nNavigate\\nLink\"]\n    end\n\n    RRD5 --> RR5\n    RR5 --> H4\n    LS --> H4\n    COMPAT --> RRD5\n    HOOKS --> COMPAT\n    COMPONENTS --> COMPAT\n\n    style RRD5 fill:#f9a825,stroke:#f57f17,color:#000\n    style RR5 fill:#f9a825,stroke:#f57f17,color:#000\n    style H4 fill:#f9a825,stroke:#f57f17,color:#000\n    style LS fill:#f9a825,stroke:#f57f17,color:#000\n    style COMPAT fill:#42a5f5,stroke:#1565c0,color:#000\n    style HOOKS fill:#66bb6a,stroke:#2e7d32,color:#000\n    style COMPONENTS fill:#66bb6a,stroke:#2e7d32,color:#000\n```\n\n---\n\n### Migration Completion Status\n\n```mermaid\npie title React Router Migration Progress\n    \"Migrated to v6 APIs (via compat)\" : 95\n    \"Still on v5 imports\" : 3\n    \"Infrastructure (root router, LocationService)\" : 2\n```\n\n#### What's done (v6-style via compat)\n\n- ~130+ files import from `react-router-dom-v5-compat`\n- All legacy v5 APIs removed from app code: `useHistory`, `withRouter`, `<Switch>`, `<Redirect>`, `Route component={...}`\n- v6 hooks (`useNavigate`, `useParams`, `useLocation`, `useSearchParams`) used throughout\n- v6 components (`<Routes>`, `<Route element={...}>`, `<Navigate>`, `<Link>`) used throughout\n\n#### What remains\n\n| Item | Status | Blocker? |\n|------|--------|----------|\n| Root `<Router>` in `RoutesWrapper.tsx` | Still v5 | Yes -- central |\n| `<CompatRouter>` bridge | Still needed | Depends on root swap |\n| `LocationService` (HistoryWrapper) | Still `history` v4 | Yes -- ~100+ files use it |\n| 6-8 files with direct v5 imports | Not yet switched | Easy fixes |\n| Data router APIs (`createBrowserRouter`, `RouterProvider`, loaders) | Not adopted | Future phase |\n| Plugin shared deps (`sharedDependencies.ts`) | Exposes both v5 + compat | Plugin ecosystem dependency |\n\n---\n\n### Remaining v5 Direct Imports\n\n```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    subgraph \"Still importing from react-router-dom (v5)\"\n        A1[\"RoutesWrapper.tsx\\n(Router)\"]\n        A2[\"TestProvider.tsx\\n(Router)\"]\n        A3[\"test-utils.tsx\\n(Router)\"]\n        A4[\"explore/spec/helper/setup.tsx\\n(Route, Router)\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"Still importing from react-router (v5)\"\n        B1[\"AppNotificationList.tsx\\n(useLocation)\"]\n        B2[\"RepositoryStatusPage.tsx\\n(useLocation)\"]\n        B3[\"FileStatusPage.tsx\\n(useLocation)\"]\n        B4[\"TabItemRenderer.tsx\\n(useLocation)\"]\n    end\n\n    style A1 fill:#ef5350,stroke:#c62828,color:#fff\n    style A2 fill:#ffb74d,stroke:#e65100,color:#000\n    style A3 fill:#ffb74d,stroke:#e65100,color:#000\n    style A4 fill:#ffb74d,stroke:#e65100,color:#000\n    style B1 fill:#ffb74d,stroke:#e65100,color:#000\n    style B2 fill:#ffb74d,stroke:#e65100,color:#000\n    style B3 fill:#ffb74d,stroke:#e65100,color:#000\n    style B4 fill:#ffb74d,stroke:#e65100,color:#000\n```\n\nRed = structural blocker (root router), Orange = straightforward to migrate.\n\n---\n\n### Migration Phases\n\n```mermaid\ngraph LR\n    P1[\"Phase 1\\nInstall compat layer\\n+ wrap with CompatRouter\"]\n    P2[\"Phase 2\\nMigrate components\\nto v6 APIs\"]\n    P3[\"Phase 3\\nSwap root Router\\nto v6 BrowserRouter\"]\n    P4[\"Phase 4\\nAdapt LocationService\\nto v6 navigation\"]\n    P5[\"Phase 5\\nRemove compat layer\\n+ adopt data router\"]\n\n    P1 -->|DONE| P2\n    P2 -->|~95% DONE| P3\n    P3 -->|NOT STARTED| P4\n    P4 -->|NOT STARTED| P5\n\n    style P1 fill:#66bb6a,stroke:#2e7d32,color:#000\n    style P2 fill:#a5d6a7,stroke:#2e7d32,color:#000\n    style P3 fill:#e0e0e0,stroke:#9e9e9e,color:#000\n    style P4 fill:#e0e0e0,stroke:#9e9e9e,color:#000\n    style P5 fill:#e0e0e0,stroke:#9e9e9e,color:#000\n```\n\n---\n\n### Key Blockers for Phase 3+\n\n1. **`LocationService`** -- wraps `history` v4 and is used by ~100+ files for imperative navigation (`push`, `replace`, `partial`). Moving to v6 means either adapting it to v6's navigation model or replacing usage with `useNavigate` hooks.\n\n2. **Plugin ecosystem** -- `sharedDependencies.ts` exposes both v5 (`react-router-dom`) and compat (`react-router`) to plugins. Legacy plugins depend on v5 APIs, making a hard cutover risky.\n\n3. **Webpack alias** -- `scripts/webpack/webpack.dev.js` resolves `react-router-dom` to the v5 package for dev linking; this needs updating when swapping to native v6.\n\n### Key Files to Watch\n\n| File | Why it matters |\n|------|----------------|\n| `public/app/routes/RoutesWrapper.tsx` | Root router -- swap point for v5 -> v6 |\n| `packages/grafana-runtime/src/services/LocationService.tsx` | Imperative nav -- must be adapted |\n| `public/app/features/plugins/loader/sharedDependencies.ts` | Plugin compat -- gates full v6 adoption |\n| `public/app/AppWrapper.tsx` | Route mapping -- already v6-style |\n| `public/app/core/navigation/GrafanaRoute.tsx` | Auth/guard wrapper -- already v6-style |",
