  "model": "claude-4.6-opus-high-thinking",
  "text": "## Grafana Codebase Overview\n\n### High-Level Architecture\n\nGrafana is a **Go + React monorepo** under AGPL-3.0. The backend lives in `pkg/`, the SPA frontend in `public/app/`, and shared TypeScript libraries in `packages/` (workspace packages like `@grafana/ui`, `@grafana/data`, `@grafana/runtime`).\n\n```mermaid\ngraph TB\n    subgraph \"Monorepo Root\"\n        direction TB\n        subgraph Backend[\"Go Backend (pkg/)\"]\n            Services[\"Services<br/>user, dashboard, alerting...\"]\n            APIs[\"REST + K8s-style APIs\"]\n            Wire[\"Wire DI\"]\n        end\n        subgraph Frontend[\"React Frontend (public/app/)\"]\n            Core[\"core/<br/>navigation, components,<br/>services, hooks\"]\n            Features[\"features/<br/>~50+ feature modules\"]\n            Routes[\"routes/<br/>route config\"]\n            AppWrapper[\"AppWrapper.tsx<br/>app shell\"]\n        end\n        subgraph Packages[\"Shared Packages (packages/)\"]\n            UI[\"@grafana/ui\"]\n            Data[\"@grafana/data\"]\n            Runtime[\"@grafana/runtime<br/>(locationService lives here)\"]\n            Scenes[\"@grafana/scenes\"]\n        end\n    end\n    Frontend --> Packages\n    Frontend --> Backend\n```\n\n**Key frontend stack:** React 18.3, Redux Toolkit, Emotion CSS, RxJS, i18next, Monaco Editor, and React Router (in migration).\n\n---\n\n## React Router Architecture\n\n### Current State: Hybrid v5/v6\n\nGrafana runs **React Router v5 (5.3.4)** as the actual router engine, layered with **`react-router-dom-v5-compat` (~6.30)** to expose v6-style APIs. The `history` package (4.10.1, patched) underpins everything via a custom `locationService` abstraction.\n\n```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    subgraph \"Router Stack (runtime)\"\n        History[\"history@4.10.1<br/>(patched, createBrowserHistory)\"]\n        LocSvc[\"locationService<br/>(@grafana/runtime)<br/>push / replace / partial / getHistory\"]\n        RRv5[\"react-router-dom@5.3.4<br/>&lt;Router history={...}&gt;\"]\n        Compat[\"react-router-dom-v5-compat@~6.30<br/>&lt;CompatRouter&gt;\"]\n        V6API[\"v6-style API surface<br/>&lt;Routes&gt; &lt;Route element={}&gt;<br/>useParams, useNavigate, useLocation, Navigate\"]\n    end\n\n    History --> LocSvc\n    LocSvc --> RRv5\n    RRv5 --> Compat\n    Compat --> V6API\n\n    subgraph \"App Code (161+ files)\"\n        Features2[\"Feature modules\"]\n        CoreNav[\"Core navigation\"]\n        Plugins[\"Plugin routes\"]\n    end\n\n    V6API --> Features2\n    V6API --> CoreNav\n    V6API --> Plugins\n    LocSvc -.->|\"imperative nav<br/>(266 files)\"| Features2\n```\n\n### Routing Wiring\n\nThe entry point chain is:\n\n```mermaid\ngraph LR\n    A[\"RoutesWrapper.tsx\"] -->|\"&lt;Router history={locationService.getHistory()}&gt;\"| B[\"react-router-dom v5 Router\"]\n    B -->|\"&lt;CompatRouter&gt;\"| C[\"v5-compat bridge\"]\n    C -->|wraps| D[\"AppChrome + AppWrapper\"]\n    D -->|\"&lt;Routes&gt;\"| E[\"Route descriptors<br/>(getAppRoutes())\"]\n    E -->|\"&lt;Route element={&lt;GrafanaRouteWrapper&gt;}&gt;\"| F[\"Feature pages\"]\n```\n\nKey files in the routing chain:\n\n| File | Role |\n|------|------|\n| `public/app/routes/RoutesWrapper.tsx` | Mounts v5 `Router` with `locationService` history, wraps in `CompatRouter` |\n| `public/app/routes/routes.tsx` | `getAppRoutes()` — builds the full `RouteDescriptor[]` array |\n| `public/app/AppWrapper.tsx` | Maps descriptors to `<Route element={<GrafanaRouteWrapper>}>` inside `<Routes>` |\n| `public/app/core/navigation/GrafanaRoute.tsx` | Error boundary, Suspense, auth checks, passes `queryParams` to pages |\n| `public/app/core/navigation/types.ts` | `RouteDescriptor`, `GrafanaRouteComponentProps` types |\n| `packages/grafana-runtime/src/services/LocationService.tsx` | `locationService` — wraps `history`, provides push/replace/partial + RxJS observable |\n\n---\n\n## Migration Status: v5 → v6\n\n### API Surface Migration: Complete\n\nAll v5-specific APIs have been eliminated from application code:\n\n```mermaid\ngraph LR\n    subgraph \"v5 APIs (ELIMINATED)\"\n        style v5 fill:#f9d0d0,stroke:#c00\n        A1[\"useHistory ✗\"]\n        A2[\"withRouter ✗\"]\n        A3[\"&lt;Switch&gt; ✗\"]\n        A4[\"&lt;Redirect&gt; ✗\"]\n        A5[\"&lt;Route component={}&gt; ✗\"]\n        A6[\"RouteComponentProps ✗\"]\n        A7[\"match.params ✗\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph v5[\"v6-style APIs via compat (IN USE)\"]\n        style v5 fill:#d0f9d0,stroke:#0a0\n        B1[\"useNavigate ✓ (25 files)\"]\n        B2[\"useParams ✓ (58 files)\"]\n        B3[\"useLocation ✓ (via compat)\"]\n        B4[\"&lt;Routes&gt; ✓ (26 files)\"]\n        B5[\"&lt;Route element={}&gt; ✓ (25 files)\"]\n        B6[\"&lt;Navigate&gt; ✓ (9 files)\"]\n    end\n```\n\n### Infrastructure Migration: Incomplete\n\nThe underlying router engine is still v5. The final migration steps remain:\n\n```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    subgraph done[\"Completed ✓\"]\n        style done fill:#d0f9d0,stroke:#0a0\n        S1[\"All route components use v6 &lt;Route element&gt;\"]\n        S2[\"All hooks migrated to useParams/useNavigate/useLocation\"]\n        S3[\"&lt;Switch&gt; → &lt;Routes&gt; everywhere\"]\n        S4[\"&lt;Redirect&gt; → &lt;Navigate&gt; everywhere\"]\n        S5[\"withRouter / RouteComponentProps eliminated\"]\n        S6[\"GrafanaRouteComponentProps replaces v5 types\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph remaining[\"Remaining ✗\"]\n        style remaining fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#f90\n        R1[\"v5 Router still the root<br/>(RoutesWrapper.tsx)\"]\n        R2[\"CompatRouter bridge still required\"]\n        R3[\"locationService wraps history@4.x<br/>(not native v6 navigation)\"]\n        R4[\"No data router adoption<br/>(createBrowserRouter = 0 uses)\"]\n        R5[\"No RouterProvider usage\"]\n        R6[\"266 files use locationService<br/>for imperative navigation\"]\n    end\n\n    done --> remaining\n    remaining -->|\"Future\"| Final[\"Full React Router v6/v7<br/>with data router APIs\"]\n```\n\n### Import Source Distribution\n\n```mermaid\npie title \"Router Import Sources Across Files\"\n    \"react-router-dom-v5-compat (v6 API)\" : 161\n    \"locationService (imperative)\" : 266\n    \"react-router-dom (v5, structural only)\" : 6\n    \"react-router (core, inconsistent)\" : 3\n```\n\nNote: `locationService` usage overlaps with compat imports — many files use both.\n\n### Residual v5 Imports (6 files)\n\nThe **6 files** still importing from plain `react-router-dom` (v5) are structural or test utilities:\n\n| File | Why |\n|------|-----|\n| `public/app/routes/RoutesWrapper.tsx` | Needs v5 `Router` to mount with `history` object |\n| `public/test/test-utils.tsx` | Test wrapper uses v5 `Router` |\n| `public/test/helpers/TestProvider.tsx` | Test wrapper uses v5 `Router` |\n| `public/app/features/explore/spec/helper/setup.tsx` | Test setup uses v5 `Route`/`Router` |\n| `public/app/core/components/AppNotifications/AppNotificationList.tsx` | `useLocation` from v5 (inconsistent) |\n| `e2e-playwright/.../App.tsx` | Test plugin uses v5 `Route`/`Routes` |\n\n### 3 files importing from `react-router` (not `-dom`)\n\nThese are minor inconsistencies — `useLocation` from `react-router` instead of the compat package:\n- `features/provisioning/Repository/RepositoryStatusPage.tsx`\n- `features/provisioning/File/FileStatusPage.tsx`\n- `features/dashboard-scene/scene/layout-tabs/TabItemRenderer.tsx`\n\n---\n\n## Summary\n\n| Dimension | Status |\n|-----------|--------|\n| **v5 API surface (hooks, components)** | Fully migrated to v6-style via compat |\n| **Route definitions** | All use v6 `<Routes>` / `<Route element>` |\n| **Underlying router engine** | Still React Router v5 `<Router history={}>` |\n| **Compat bridge** | Required (`CompatRouter` in 4 files) |\n| **`locationService` abstraction** | Heavily used (266 files), wraps `history@4.x` |\n| **Data router (v6.4+)** | Not adopted (0 uses of `createBrowserRouter` / `RouterProvider`) |\n| **Plugin ecosystem** | Docs deprecate v5 for plugins; plugins get v6 via shared `react-router-dom-v5-compat` |\n\nThe migration is in a **stable intermediate state**: all application code speaks v6 APIs, but the runtime is still a v5 `Router` with a `CompatRouter` bridge. The next phase would involve replacing the v5 `Router` + `history` with a native v6 `BrowserRouter` or data router (`createBrowserRouter`), and unwinding the 266-file dependency on `locationService` as the imperative navigation channel.",
