  "model": "composer-2-fast",
  "text": "\nCreated **`/.cursorignore`** at the repo root (Cursor expects this lowercase name, not `.CursorIgnore`).\n\nIt ignores:\n\n| Category | Patterns |\n|--------|----------|\n| **Dependencies / vendor** | `node_modules/`, `vendor/`, Yarn PnP caches |\n| **Build artifacts** | `dist/`, `build/`, `public/build/`, `bin/`, coverage/playwright reports, `.nx/`, `npm-artifacts/`, etc. |\n| **Generated code** | `wire_gen.go` / `*_wire_gen.go`, `public/api-spec.json`, locale build output, `manifest.json`, auto-generated docs API |\n| **Logs & change dumps** | `*.log`, `cursor-audit.log`, `docs/changed-files`, common server/e2e logs |\n| **Caches** | `.awcache/`, `tmp/`, ESLint/stylelint caches |\n\n**Note:** Ignoring every `*.log` hides all log files from Cursor indexing. If you need AI context inside specific tracked logs, trim that line or narrow the path.\n\nIf you meant **release changelogs** (e.g. `CHANGELOG.md`) rather than **log / audit files**, say so and we can adjust—right now `CHANGELOG*` is not ignored so those stay visible.",
