  "model": "claude-4.6-opus-high-thinking",
  "text": "Here's a concise list of the **6 files** that still import directly from `react-router` or `react-router-dom` (v5) instead of `react-router-dom-v5-compat`:\n\n---\n\n### Production code (best candidates for a small migration)\n\n1. **`public/app/features/provisioning/File/FileStatusPage.tsx`**\n   - Imports `useLocation` from `react-router` (v5)\n   - Already imports `useParams` from `react-router-dom-v5-compat` on the same line — so it's a split import.\n   - **Fix:** Change `useLocation` import source to `react-router-dom-v5-compat` (or switch to `locationService.getLocation()`).\n\n2. **`public/app/features/dashboard-scene/scene/layout-tabs/TabItemRenderer.tsx`**\n   - Imports `useLocation` from `react-router` (v5).\n   - **Fix:** Same as above — switch to compat or `locationService`.\n\nThese two are the simplest, lowest-risk migrations. Each is a one-line import change.\n\n---\n\n### Test infrastructure\n\n3. **`public/test/helpers/TestProvider.tsx`**\n   - Imports `Router` from `react-router-dom` (v5). Has an `eslint-disable` comment acknowledging the v5 usage.\n   - Used alongside `CompatRouter` from the compat package.\n\n4. **`public/test/test-utils.tsx`**\n   - Same pattern: `Router` from `react-router-dom` (v5), plus `CompatRouter`.\n\n5. **`public/app/features/explore/spec/helper/setup.tsx`**\n   - Imports **both** `Route` and `Router` from `react-router-dom` (v5).\n   - This is the most v5-heavy test helper remaining.\n\nThese three test files use the v5 `<Router history={...}>` to inject a test history. Migrating them requires deciding on a v6-compatible test `Router` strategy (e.g., `MemoryRouter` from the compat package), so they're a bit more involved.\n\n---\n\n### Core routing shell (do not touch for a small migration)\n\n6. **`public/app/routes/RoutesWrapper.tsx`**\n   - Imports `Router` from `react-router-dom` (v5). This is the **root of the routing tree** — it's the v5 `<Router history={locationService.getHistory()}>` that the entire app sits inside.\n   - This is **intentionally v5** and is the last piece to migrate. Don't change it without a broader plan for `locationService`.\n\n---\n\n### Recommended starting point\n\nFor a small, safe migration, start with the **two production files**:\n\n| File | What to change |\n|------|----------------|\n| `FileStatusPage.tsx` | `useLocation` from `'react-router'` → `'react-router-dom-v5-compat'` |\n| `TabItemRenderer.tsx` | `useLocation` from `'react-router'` → `'react-router-dom-v5-compat'` |\n\nBoth are single-line import source swaps with zero behavioral change — the `useLocation` API is identical between the two packages. After those, the explore test helper (`setup.tsx`) would be the next step up in complexity.",
