  "text": "All tasks completed. Here's a summary of the migration:\n\n## Changes Made\n\n### 1. Migrated `SignInLink.tsx`\n- Removed `useLocation` import from `react-router-dom-v5-compat`\n- Added `locationService` import from `@grafana/runtime`\n- Changed `useLocation()` call to `locationService.getLocation()`\n\n### 2. Migrated `useQueryParams.ts`\n- Removed `useLocation` import from `react-router-dom-v5-compat`\n- Changed `useLocation().search` to `locationService.getLocation().search`\n- Preserved the return contract and `locationService.partial()` update path\n\n### 3. Created tests for `useQueryParams`\n- New test file: `public/app/core/hooks/useQueryParams.test.ts`\n- Tests cover: empty params, params parsing, update function, replace flag, and array values\n\n### 4. Updated migration status documentation\n- Added entries for `SignInLink` and `useQueryParams (hook)` to `location-service-migration-status.md`\n- Documented migration dates, patterns, affected behavior, and notes\n\n### 5. Verification\n- All 9 tests pass (4 existing SignInLink tests + 5 new useQueryParams tests)\n- No lint errors in any modified files",
