  "text": "Created the subagent at `.cursor/agents/location-service-migration-docs.md`.\n\n## Subagent Details\n\n| Field | Value |\n|-------|-------|\n| **Name** | `location-service-migration-docs` |\n| **Location** | Project-level (`.cursor/agents/`) |\n| **Scope** | This Grafana codebase |\n\n## What It Does\n\nWhen invoked after completing a locationService migration, it will:\n\n1. Read the current `location-service-migration-status.md` document\n2. Add a properly formatted entry for the migrated file with:\n   - File path\n   - Migration date\n   - Previous React Router pattern\n   - New locationService pattern\n   - Affected behavior\n   - Implementation notes\n3. Maintain consistency with existing entries\n\n## Usage\n\nAfter migrating a file, invoke it with:\n\n```\nUse the location-service-migration-docs subagent to document the migration of [file path]\n```\n\nOr it should be used proactively after any locationService migration since the description includes \"use proactively.\"",
