  "text": "\nUsing the **Grafana dev startup** flow, both processes are running in the background from the repo root.\n\n### Status\n\n| Process | Result |\n|--------|--------|\n| **Frontend** | `yarn start:liveReload` — LiveReload on **35750**, webpack reports **Grafana: Compiled successfully** (~10s). |\n| **Backend** | `make run` — log shows **`HTTP Server Listen` on `[::]:3000`**. |\n\n### Where to open Grafana\n\n- **UI + API:** [http://localhost:3000](http://localhost:3000)\n\n### Notes\n\n1. **Node** — Build warned that **24.2.0** is in use while **.nvmrc** asks for **24.11.0**. If you see odd frontend issues, switch with `nvm use` (or similar).\n\n2. **TypeScript** — After compile, the checker reported errors (e.g. missing `collapseRowsOnLoad` on v2 `Spec`, `CreateNewButton.tsx` / `locationService`). That matches an in-progress branch; webpack still completed. Fixing those will clear the checker noise.\n\nKeep both jobs running while you develop. If you hit **`EMFILE`**, restart the frontend with `ulimit -n 65536` first (already used for this run).",
